WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:02.420
- This is my favorite story, y'all,

00:00:02.420 --> 00:00:04.100
because this happens a lot in families,

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:05.010
where people, they don't,

00:00:05.010 --> 00:00:06.130
especially not coming from the south,

00:00:06.130 --> 00:00:09.360
and people don't grow up
around the gay culture,

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:10.510
so they're kind of thrown by it,

00:00:10.510 --> 00:00:12.270
and they don't know how
to handle it at first,

00:00:12.270 --> 00:00:13.200
and I love y'all--
- Absolutely.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:14.130
- So much for sharing this story,

00:00:14.130 --> 00:00:15.970
it's gonna inspire so many people,

00:00:15.970 --> 00:00:18.170
but were you always into makeup?

00:00:18.170 --> 00:00:19.230
Were you--

00:00:19.230 --> 00:00:20.740
- I was actually always into makeup.

00:00:20.740 --> 00:00:22.660
I loved it, I loved seeing my
mom transform in the morning,

00:00:22.660 --> 00:00:25.310
I loved seeing her turn into Superwoman.

00:00:25.310 --> 00:00:27.140
I could see the transformation in her.

00:00:27.140 --> 00:00:29.437
She felt more confident, she
loved it, and I was like,

00:00:29.437 --> 00:00:32.463
"Oh my God, mom, this is
amazing," and I loved it.

00:00:32.463 --> 00:00:33.930
- I love that, all right,

00:00:33.930 --> 00:00:36.480
did you struggle with
Manny's interest at first?

00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:38.290
- I definitely did.

00:00:38.290 --> 00:00:40.640
Growing up in a Latino household,

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:44.909
the LGBT community
discussions never happened.

00:00:44.909 --> 00:00:48.630
It was something new to me, so,

00:00:48.630 --> 00:00:52.310
I had a real hard time understanding it,

00:00:52.310 --> 00:00:54.600
and accepting it, and--

00:00:54.600 --> 00:00:55.556
- 'Cause you didn't grow up around it.

00:00:55.556 --> 00:00:56.389
- No, I did not.

00:00:56.389 --> 00:00:57.230
- You grew up in a
completely different world.

00:00:57.230 --> 00:00:58.540
- Exactly, exactly--
- Yeah.

00:00:58.540 --> 00:00:59.520
- So it was very rough.

00:00:59.520 --> 00:01:01.540
- So, Eva, beauty acceptance is a

00:01:01.540 --> 00:01:03.990
big part of your brand,
do you relate to this?

00:01:03.990 --> 00:01:06.680
- Oh, completely, especially
what you were talking about.

00:01:06.680 --> 00:01:09.189
My mother is my biggest
beauty inspiration.

00:01:09.189 --> 00:01:10.022
- [Manny] Same.

00:01:10.022 --> 00:01:11.940
- And those memories of watching her,

00:01:11.940 --> 00:01:14.010
transform is a perfect word.

00:01:14.010 --> 00:01:16.420
She used to work at the
Hollywood Chinese Theater.

00:01:16.420 --> 00:01:17.253
- [Kelly] Yeah?

00:01:17.253 --> 00:01:19.350
- And back in the 80s,
I'd go to work with her,

00:01:19.350 --> 00:01:24.270
and she had to wear the very Chinese,

00:01:24.270 --> 00:01:25.300
I don't know what the proper word is--

00:01:25.300 --> 00:01:26.260
- The ensemble that they were
in, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:01:26.260 --> 00:01:29.260
- That gown with the
high collar, and the red,

00:01:29.260 --> 00:01:31.380
and I would watch, and we'd be on the bus.

00:01:31.380 --> 00:01:33.750
It would be super not elegant,

00:01:33.750 --> 00:01:35.137
except she would be this--

00:01:36.140 --> 00:01:36.973
- Beacon, yeah.

00:01:36.973 --> 00:01:39.100
- This thing, and so that inspired me,

00:01:39.100 --> 00:01:40.590
and continues to inspire me,

00:01:40.590 --> 00:01:43.133
that image of my mother
being this goddess.

00:01:43.133 --> 00:01:44.110
- Absolutely.
- Absolutely.

00:01:44.110 --> 00:01:46.210
- I hope my daughter thinks I'm a goddess.

